// Using `signal` without `use std.reactive` is an unknown name (E0005) — the reactive constructors
// left the always-global prelude (prelude-redesign P2a), so the bare name resolves like any other
// missing identifier, identically on both backends.
// expect: error E0005 at 6:5
// expect: exit 1
s = signal(0)
echo s.get()
